{
  "key": 42002,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000155_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: Hmm...\n",
        "A key is necessary for us to go on.\r",
        "For the time being, we cannot give\n",
        "chase to those who run away.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000155_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: Ah, this Hidden Machine...\n",
        "It is of the hidden move Fly.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, this, you should be\n",
        "keeping.\r",
        "It will not do to leave this item here\n",
        "to be used by the Team Galactic.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000155_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: So, we did not learn very much\n",
        "from this exercise... No matter.\r",
        "What concerns me is what I have\n",
        "overheard in the Game Corner.\r",
        "The Team Galactic has transported \n",
        "something to Pastoria City.\r",
        "What they are up to, I do not know, but\n",
        "I have bad feelings about it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000155_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: I am concerned over what I\n",
        "have overheard in the Game Corner.\r",
        "The Team Galactic has transported\n",
        "something to Pastoria City.\r",
        "What they are up to, I do not know, but\n",
        "I have bad feelings about it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000155_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: Ah, hello!\n",
        "I have kept you waiting.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000155_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: I will use this Storage Key I\n",
        "have obtained from the Team Galactic...\r",
        "...Ker-chunk!\r",
        "Yes!\n",
        "It is opened!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000155_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "I will go on ahead, my friend.\n",
        "Do not expose yourself to danger!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000155_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "The rust-encrusted door is locked.\n",
        "It appears to take a special key.\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000155_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "The rust-encrusted door is locked.\n",
        "It appears to take a special key.\r",
        "Use the Storage Key?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000155_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} inserted and turned the\n",
        "Storage Key.\r",
        "The rusty door creaked open!\r",
        "The Storage Key snapped off inside\n",
        "the keyhole..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneWarehouse_Text_Arc2LookerSentries",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: Two sentries. They look one\n",
        "way, then the other.\r",
        "We move when they look away.\n",
        "If they see you, we start again."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneWarehouse_Text_Arc2Spotted",
      "en_US": [
        "Eclipse Grunt: Hey! You! This is a\n",
        "private depot! Scram, kid!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneWarehouse_Text_Arc2LookerAgain",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: Again. Quieter. Like a\n",
        "Glameow in socks."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneWarehouse_Text_Arc2Manifest",
      "en_US": [
        "A shipping manifest. Next delivery:\r",
        "ROUTE 213. THE CAVES.\n",
        "TWO FRAMES. TWO SUBJECTS."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneWarehouse_Text_Arc2LookerThereItIs",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: Route 213. There it is.\r",
        "Go. I will finish copying.\n",
        "Make a little noise by the trucks."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneWarehouse_Text_Arc2LookerNoise",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: The trucks. A little noise.\n",
        "Go."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneWarehouse_Text_Arc2GuardKid",
      "en_US": [
        "Eclipse Grunt: A kid? In here?\r",
        "Get away from the trucks!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneWarehouse_Text_Arc2GuardSecond",
      "en_US": [
        "Eclipse Grunt: You're not getting\n",
        "near those trucks!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneWarehouse_Text_Arc2IndraEnough",
      "en_US": "Indra: That's enough."
    },
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneWarehouse_Text_Arc2IndraRowans",
      "en_US": [
        "Indra: You're Rowan's. The one with\n",
        "the guide.\r",
        "Trucks, go. Now. I'll keep this one\n",
        "busy."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneWarehouse_Text_Arc2IndraAfter",
      "en_US": [
        "Indra: Hm. You fight like somebody\n",
        "who's never lost anything.\r",
        "Keep it that way."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneWarehouse_Text_Arc2IndraGoHome",
      "en_US": [
        "Indra: Go home, kid. Somebody's\n",
        "waiting there.\r",
        "Don't make them wait forever."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneWarehouse_Text_Arc2LookerEveryPage",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: I have it. Every page.\r",
        "...Who was that woman?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneWarehouse_Text_Arc2LookerFree",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: She let you go. People like\n",
        "that never do anything for free."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneWarehouse_Text_Arc2Closed",
      "en_US": [
        "The depot is locked up tight.\n",
        "The trucks are long gone."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneWarehouse_Text_Arc2Empty",
      "en_US": [
        "The bay is empty. Fresh tire marks\n",
        "run out through the big door."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
